hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1131","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Qaum ka tosha kam ho gaya aur wo mohtaaj ho gaey. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas apne oonton ko nahr karney (key baarey mein) aey. To Aap ne unhey ijazat dey di. To unhey Umar milay aur unhon-ne unhey khabar di. To unhon-ne kaha: Unka unkey oonton key baad rehna kaisa hoga? To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas daakhil huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Unka unkey oonton key baad rehna kaisa hoga? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein pukaaro ke wo apne bachey huey toshon key sath aaein. To uskey liye dastarkhwaan bichaaya gaya aur unhon-ne use dastarkhwaan par rakkha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur dua ki aur us par barkat ki. Phir unhey apne bartanon key sath bulaaya. To logon ne bhara yahan tak ke faarigh ho gaey. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun. (Bukhari: 2484)"
"1132","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Ashaari jab ghazwe mein faqueer ho jaatey ya Madina mein unkey ghar walon ka khaana kam ho jaata to jo unkey paas hota use aik kapdey mein jama kartey, phir use aapas mein aik bartan mein baraabari se taqseem kartey. To wo mujh se hain aur main un se hun. (Bukhari: 2486)"
"1133","[AI-translation] Raafe bin Khadeej se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Zul Hulaifa mein they. To logon ko bhook lagi aur unhey oont aur bakriyaan (maal-e-ganeemat mein) milein. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qaum key peechey they. To unhon-ne jaldi ki aur zibah kya aur haandiyaan rakkhein. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne haandiyon ka hukm diya aur wo undel di gaein. Phir taqseem kya. To das bakriyon ko oont key baraabar karaar diya. To un mein se oont bhaag gaya. To unhon-ne use talaash kya aur wo unhey aajiz kar gaya. Aur qaum mein thodey ghodey they. To un mein se aik aadmi ne teer se ishaara kya aur Allah ne use rok diya. Phir farmaya: Beshak in jaanvaron mein jangli pan hai jangli jaanvaron jaisa. Phir jo tum par ghaalib aaey to uskey sath aisa karo. To merey daada ne kaha: Beshak ham kal dushman ki ummeed ya khauf rakhtey hain jabke hamaarey paas chhuriyaan nahi hain. To kya ham narkul se zibah karein? Aap ne farmaya: Jo khoon baha dey aur us par Allah ka naam liya gaya ho use khaao, daant aur naakhun key siwa. Aur main tumhey uskey baarey mein bataaunga: Daant to haddi hai. Aur naakhun to Habsha ki chhuriyaan hain. (Bukhari: 2488)"
"1134","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulaam mein se hissa aazaad karey to us par apne maal mein use poora aazaad karna hai. Phir agar uskey paas maal na ho to ghulaam ki munaasib qeemat lagaai jaaeygi, phir us se kamaane key liye kaha jaaeyga baghair us par sakhti kiye. (Bukhari: 2492)"
"1135","[AI-translation] Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki hadon par qaem rehne waley aur un mein padney waley ki misaal aisi qaum jaisi hai jinhon-ne kashti par qura andaazi ki. To baaz ko uska upar hissa mila aur baaz ko uska neechey hissa. To jo uskey neechey they jab paani letey to un par se guzartey jo unkey upar they. To unhon-ne kaha: Kaash ham apne hissey mein suraakh kar lein aur unhey takleef na dein jo hamarey upar hain. Phir agar wo unhey chhorein aur jo wo chaahtey hain to wo sab halaak ho jaaengey. Aur agar wo unkey haathon ko pakdein to bach jaaengey aur sab bach jaaengey. (Bukhari: 2493)"
"1136","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Hishaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paaya tha. Aur unhey unki waalida Zainab bint Humaid Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas ley gaein aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us se baiat lijiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo chhota hai. To Aap ne uskey sar par haath phera aur uskey liye dua ki. Aur wo baazaar ki taraf nikaltey aur khaana khareedtey. To unhey Ibn Umar aur Ibn Zubair (Raziallahu anhum) miltey aur un donon se kehtey: Hamein shareek karo, beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumharey liye barkat ki dua ki hai. To wo unhey shareek kartey. To baaz auqaat sawaari jaisi thi waisi milti. To use ghar ki taraf bhejey. (Bukhari: 2501-2502). Jaabir se aur Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba Zul Hijja ki chauthi ki subah tashreef laaey jabke wo Hajj ka talbiya kehtey huey they, unhey koi cheez milawat na karti thi. Phir jab ham tashreef laaey to Aap ne hamein hukm diya. To ham ne use Umrah banaaya aur ke ham apni biwiyon ki taraf halaal hon. To uskey baarey mein baat phail gai. Ataa ne kaha: To Jaabir ne kaha: Ham mein se koi Mina ki taraf jaata hai jabke uska zikr mani tapak raha hota hai. To Jaabir ne apni hatheli se (ishaara kya). To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap khateeb ho kar khadey huey aur farmaya: Mujhey pahunchi hai ke qaumein aisa aisa kehti hain. Allah ki qasam! Beshak main un se zyada nek aur Allah se darney wala hun. Aur agar main apne muamley mein pehley jaanta jo baad mein jaana to qurbaani sath na laata. Aur agar merey paas qurbaani na hoti to halaal ho jaata. To Suraaqa bin Maalik bin Joasham khadey huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya wo hamaarey liye hai ya hamesha key liye? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke hamesha key liye. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Ali bin Abi Taalib aey. To unhon-ne kaha: Un donon mein se aik kehta hai: Haaazir hun uskey sath jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne talbiya kaha. Aur kaha: Aur doosrey ne kaha: Haaazir hun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key Hajj key sath. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke wo apne ehraam par qaem rahey. Aur use qurbaani mein shareek kya. (2505). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Shehar mein girwi rakhney ki kitaab."
